export anchor PictureBookStyle:
    number: 64
    screen: Onboarding
    name: Picture book
    idea: The setup reads like a children's picture book, with crayon drawings, wobbly hand-cut boxes and big friendly words across a two-page spread.
    base: light
    palette:
        paper: #fff8e1, the page behind the book, with a faint dotted grain
        page: #fffdf4, the open book and the style sheet card
        ink: #2b2118, text and every outline
        pencil: #5c5047, field labels, hints and page numbers
        crayonBlue: #1f4fbf, the Continue button, links and the focus outline
        crayonRed: #c8231b, the You are here and Still writing words and the title underline
        crayonGreen: #1e7b34, the done step and the Added sticker
        crayonYellow: #ffd84d, the seat sticky note, heading highlights and the current star
        orange: #f08a24, sun rays and faces, as fill only
        sky: #cfe6ff, role tags and the Copy invite link button
    type:
        A rounded hand font, Comic Sans MS, Chalkboard SE, Comic Neue, Segoe
        Print, Bradley Hand, Marker Felt, then Trebuchet MS and Verdana. The
        heading is 52px bold at 1.05 line height. The lead line is 21px,
        body is 18px at 1.55, buttons are 20 to 22px bold, and labels are
        15px in pencil grey. Everything is sentence case.
    layout:
        A small top line with a sun logo on the left and a smiling face with
        Hello, Mara Okafor on the right. Below it the screen is an open book
        in a two to three column split with a soft gutter shadow in the
        middle. The left page has a tilted yellow Step 2 of 4 label, a
        crayon drawing of Mara on a hill waving to three stick friends, and
        the four steps as a vertical list of stepping stones. The right page
        has the big heading with a red crayon underline, the line, the
        invites as hand-cut cards, the seat note as a tilted sticky note,
        Copy invite link, then Back, a wavy underlined Skip for now and a
        big Continue at the far right. Small page 2 and page 3 numbers sit
        at the bottom corners. Below 900px the pages stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px page padding, 16px between invite cards, 24px between groups.
    density: Very loose. One idea per line, with words big enough to read aloud.
    corners:
        Wobbly elliptical radii, 255px 18px 225px 18px over 18px 225px 18px
        255px, and a second mirrored set, so no two boxes match. Cards are
        rotated by half a degree, the sticky note by about one degree.
    borders: 3px solid ink on every box. Things not done yet use a 3px dashed ink border.
    shadows: One flat offset of 4px 5px with no blur at 18 percent ink, on the book, the note and Continue.
    icons:
        Hand-drawn inline SVG passed through a turbulence displacement
        filter for crayon wobble, with a second grain filter giving waxy
        fills. A green tick disc marks done, a yellow star marks the
        current step, and dashed numbered ovals mark later steps. Added
        shows a green crayon tick and the typed row shows a yellow pencil.
        Seats are five little people, three filled red and two dashed.
    focus: A 4px dashed crayon blue outline offset 4px. A focused field turns its 3px underline blue.
    tone: Cheerful and short, such as You are here, Still writing, Coming up and Done, gold star.
